    "media:imagetext": "CONSIGNES DE SECURITE * SAFETY REGULATIONS\nSUPER 12\nCEINTURES DE SÉCURITE...\nA SERRER LE PLUS POSSIBLE.\nSAFETY BELTS...\nTO BE FASTENED AS TIGHT AS POSSIBLE.\nOVERT\nOPEN\nOUVERT\nOPEN\n®\nAIR\nINTER\nRAMPE D'EVACUATION\nESCAPE SLIDE\nKEEP\nA WAY\nOUVERTURE D'UN HUBLOT\nOPENING OF A WINDOW\n1°\nTOURNEZ\nTURN\n20 SOULEVEZ\nLIFT DOOR UP\n1°\nBASCULEZ\nOPEN HANDLE\n20 OUVREZ\nOPEN DOOR\nPILAN SEE OTHER SIDE\nVOIR AU VERSO\nEXIT\nPANNEAU\nINDIQUANT LA\nPOSITION\nDES\nISSUES\nDE\nSECOURS\nEMERGENCY EXITS\nPOSITION\nADVISE YOU TO KEEP YOUR SEAT BELTS FASTENED\nALL THE TIME YOU ARE SEATED.\nAS UNFORESEEABLE TURBULANCES MAY OCCUR, WE\nETES ASSIS.\nSUPER 12\nTURE ATTACHÉE PENDANT TOUT LE TEMPS OU VOUS\nDES TURBULENCES IMPRÉVUES POUVANT SE PRODUIRE,\nNOUS VOUS CONSEILLONS DE CONSERVER VOTRE CEIN-\n1°\nOUVREZ LE VOLET\nPULL COVER OPEN\n2°\nTIREZ LA POIGNÉE ROUGE\nGRASP RED HANDLE AND PULL\nLIBÉREZ L'ISSUE, PASSEZ-LA A L'EXTÉRIEUR\n3DISCARD ENTIRE WINDOW, THROW IT OUTWARDS",
    "media:imagetext_created": 1787974605,
